nergy Corporation (the \u201cManager\u201d) and the shareholders of the Fund, which addresses matters such as the authority and voting rights of the Manager and shareholders, capitalization, transferability of membership interests, participation in costs and revenues, distribution of assets and dissolution and winding up. The Fund was organized to primarily acquire interests in oil and gas properties located in the United States offshore waters of Texas, Louisiana and Alabama in the Gulf of America.","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1455741/000121465925015886/x101425910q.htm","filed":"2025-11-04","source":"10-Q"},"da_v":2}